      123.72,
      407.57,
      288.91,
      420.06
    ],
    "text": "My Reference No.: PUT/LND/01/01/06",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      1.0199999809265137,
      10.020000457763672
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.76,
      420.59,
      289.98,
      521.38
    ],
    "text": "I, hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as Amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intends to acquire the following land for the construction of pump House operator quarters of Puttalam Water Supply Scheme.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.020000457763672,
      12.0,
      16.020000457763672
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.76,
      521.71,
      286.56,
      636.72
    ],
    "text": "Description of the land or servitude to be acquired: An allotments of land described below bearing Lot No. 2 depicted preliminary plan PU 5040 prepared on 01.11.2012 by the Puttalam District Superintendent of surveys in total extent of 0.0074 Hectare situated in 617B Puttalama east Grama Niladhari Division in the village of Manalgunduwa in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Puttalama in Puttalam District, bounded as follows.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      3.0,
      10.020000457763672,
      16.020000457763672
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      330.25,
      539.48,
      387.3
    ],
    "text": "North: Lot No. 1 Preliminary Plan No. 5040 and Manalgunduwa Thottam land; East: Nedumkulam Thottam land claimed by jumma mosque; South: Nedumkulam Thottam land claimed by jumma mosque and Urban council road; West: Urban council road",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.020000457763672
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      387.73,
      539.52,
      513.78
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land is to be acquired are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at Divisional Secretariat Puttalam on the 11th day of November 2015, at 10.00 a. m. and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 04th day of November, 2015 the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars or their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.020000457763672
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      514.18,
      536.07,
      575.2
    ],
    "text": "M. R. M. MALIK, Divisional Secretary, Puttalam.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
